# REST

## 1.Admin

### 1.1 Login
POST http://localhost:9092/admin/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "{{$dotenv ADMIN_EMAIL}}",
    "password": "{{$dotenv ADMIN_PASSWORD}}",
    "rememberMe": false
}

### 1.2 Register
POST http://localhost:9092/admin/register-admin
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "registrationToken": "{{$dotenv ADMIN_REGISTRATION_TOKEN}}",
    "userInfo": {
        "firstname": "{{$dotenv ADMIN_FIRSTNAME}}",
        "lastname": "{{$dotenv ADMIN_LASTNAME}}",
        "password": "{{$dotenv ADMIN_PASSWORD}}"
    }
}

### 1.3 Forgot Password
POST http://localhost:9092/admin/forgot-password
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "{{$dotenv ADMIN_EMAIL}}"
}

### 1.3.1 Reset Password
POST http://localhost:9092/admin/reset-password
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "resetPasswordToken": "{{$dotenv ADMIN_RESET_TOKEN}}",
    "password": "{{$dotenv ADMIN_NEW_PASSWORD}}"
}

### 1.4 Profile
GET http://localhost:9092/admin/users/me
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{$dotenv ADMIN_TOKEN}}

## 2.User

### 2.1 Login
POST http://localhost:9092/api/auth/local
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "identifier": "{{$dotenv USER_EMAIL}}",
    "password": "{{$dotenv USER_PASSWORD}}"
}

### 2.2 Register
POST http://localhost:9092/api/auth/local/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "{{$dotenv USER_USERNAME}}",
    "email": "{{$dotenv USER_EMAIL}}",
    "password": "{{$dotenv USER_PASSWORD}}"
}

### 2.3 Forgot Password
POST http://localhost:9092/api/auth/forgot-password
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "{{$dotenv USER_EMAIL}}"
}

### 2.3.1 Reset Password
POST http://localhost:9092/api/auth/reset-password
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "code": "{{$dotenv USER_RESET_CODE}}",
    "password": "{{$dotenv USER_NEW_PASSWORD}}",
    "passwordConfirmation": "{{$dotenv USER_NEW_PASSWORD}}"
}

### 2.4 Profile
GET http://localhost:9092/api/users/me
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{$dotenv USER_JWT}}


## 3.Content

### 3.1 Student

#### 3.1.1 Create
POST http://localhost:9092/api/students
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{$dotenv REST_API_TOKEN}}

{
    "data": {
        "firstName": "Somchai",
        "lastName": "Jaidee",
        "studentCode": "65001",
        "email": "somchai@example.com"
    }
}

#### 3.1.2 List All
GET http://localhost:9092/api/students
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{$dotenv REST_API_TOKEN}}

#### 3.1.3 List with ID
GET http://localhost:9092/api/students/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{$dotenv REST_API_TOKEN}}

#### 3.1.4 Update
PUT http://localhost:9092/api/students/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{$dotenv REST_API_TOKEN}}

{
    "data": {
        "firstName": "Somchai-Updated"
    }
}

### 3.2 Subject

#### 3.2.1 Create
POST http://localhost:9092/api/subjects
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{$dotenv REST_API_TOKEN}}

{
    "data": {
        "subjectName": "Cyber Security",
        "subjectCode": "CS301",
        "credit": 3
    }
}

#### 3.2.2 List All
GET http://localhost:9092/api/subjects
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{$dotenv REST_API_TOKEN}}

#### 3.2.3 List with ID
GET http://localhost:9092/api/subjects/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{$dotenv REST_API_TOKEN}}

#### 3.2.4 Update
PUT http://localhost:9092/api/subjects/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{$dotenv REST_API_TOKEN}}

{
    "data": {
        "credit": 4
    }
}

### 3.3 Teacher

#### 3.3.1 Create
POST http://localhost:9092/api/teachers
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{$dotenv REST_API_TOKEN}}

{
    "data": {
        "firstName": "Prawee",
        "lastName": "Wongsa",
        "teacherCode": "T001",
        "email": "prawee@example.com"
    }
}

#### 3.3.2 List All
GET http://localhost:9092/api/teachers
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{$dotenv REST_API_TOKEN}}

#### 3.3.3 List with ID
GET http://localhost:9092/api/teachers/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{$dotenv REST_API_TOKEN}}

#### 3.3.4 Update
PUT http://localhost:9092/api/teachers/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{$dotenv REST_API_TOKEN}}

{
    "data": {
        "lastName": "Wongsa-Updated"
    }
}